  "prefLabel": "Ins 310.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 310.02 Scope. This part shall apply only to the solicitation or sale of any life insurance or annuity product by an insurer or insurance producer to an active duty service member of the United States armed forces.\n\nSource. #9042, eff 12-1-07, EXPIRED: 12-1-15\n\nNew. #11078, eff 4-22-16; ss by #14639, eff 6-27-26, EXPIRES: 6-27-36",
